Applied? Update your details and view your application progress. Login Subscribe Keep informed about job opportunities at Seton Hall University Job Alert Human Resources Seton Hall Mission Statement Seton Hall: A Catholic University Human Resources Home Careers at Seton Hall Thank you for your interest in working with Seton Hall University. All applicants must create an online application to be considered for any open position. Please note, employment is contingent upon satisfactory criminal and other relevant background investigations. The determination of satisfactory is at the sole discretion of Seton Hall University. Resumes received outside of the online application process will not be accepted. If special accommodations are needed in order to apply for a position, please contact the Department of Human Resources . Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Location Closes Adjunct Professor-Introduction to Ethics and Introduction to Biomedical Ethics South Orange Adjunct Professor - Information Technology Management South Orange Adjunct Instructor - Professional Psychology & Family Therapy South Orange Faculty, Adjunct South Orange Adjunct Instructor - K-12 Education Leadership Programs South Orange Adjunct Instructor – Higher Education Leadership Programs South Orange Adjunct Instructor, Master of Arts in Museum Professions South Orange Adjunct Instructor, Art History South Orange Adjunct Instructor - Foundations - Fine Art South Orange Adjunct Instructor - Animation & Game Design South Orange Adjunct Instructor, Advertising & Design South Orange Adjunct Instructor, Theatre South Orange Adjunct Instructor - Music South Orange Adjunct Instructor